description:
Schema for the per-ceremony source files consumed by scripts/enrich-awards-with-precursors.js. Catches transcription typos (mis-named category, missing required field) at script-start instead of silently lowering scores at merge time. Three top-level data shapes are supported:
  (a) DD/OCC/DL: data is an object keyed by category name → array of {year, winner|null, nominees[]}
  (b) NYDCCC: data is an object keyed by category name → array of {year, winner|null}  (no nominees)
  (c) Pulitzer: data is an array of {year, winner, finalists[]}
  (d) Pulitzer historic: data is an array of {year, winnerId?, finalistIds?[]}
The loader picks the appropriate inline schema via `oneOf`.
